			"reference": "B152, SexAndPreg:30",
			"local_notes": "Treated as Sadism for point costs, though sometimes you can restrict your sadism to sexual situations in which case it is reduced by -10 or -20%, if you only want to inflict minor/superficial pain, and restrict it to sexual situations the modifier may be as low as -80% (or possibly a quirk) but this is at the GM discretion. Sexual Masochism is the desire to be in painful sexual situations and takes modifiers as per sadism.\n\nA pimp who would express any sort of violence toward a pregnant whore is eligible for the full blown disadvantage.",
